Falcon runs on OpenClaw (https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw), which Falcon's installer downloads
and installs unchanged from OpenClaw's official installer. Falcon keeps OpenClaw's settings in its
own folder, reached through OpenClaw's standard path, and gives its start-up item Falcon's name, using
an option OpenClaw provides. OpenClaw is
